    description: "Application log samples with raw multiline content."
    shapeIndex: 4
    mamlText: "{\n  application: \"platforms\"\n  log_format: \"structured\"\n  # Example stack trace\n  sample_error: \"\"\"\nError: The FTP bus is down, hack the open-source port so we can copy the SAS program!\n    at /etc/defaults/geez.mpg4:216\n    at /srv/trash_inasmuch.3g2:128\n    at process.main (node:internal/main:1:1)\n\"\"\"\n\n  # Sample HTTP request\n  sample_request: \"\"\"\nGET /api/yin HTTP/1.1\nHost: phony-bathhouse.biz\nUser-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 6.3; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/564.74 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/102.7.7.0 Safari/546.55 Edg/129.8.2.9\nAccept: application/json\n\"\"\"\n  retention_days: 52\n}"
  }
  {
    num: "15093"
    title: "Shell Scripts"
    description: "Embedded shell scripts as raw strings."
    shapeIndex: 4
    mamlText: "# Automation scripts\n{\n  name: \"setup\"\n  shell: \"/bin/sh\"\n  # Initial setup script\n  setup: \"\"\"\n#!/bin/bash\nset -euo pipefail\n\necho \"Setting up environment...\"\nnpm install\nnpm run build\necho \"Done!\"\n\"\"\"\n\n  # Deployment script\n  deploy: \"\"\"\n#!/bin/bash\nset -euo pipefail\n\nVERSION=$(git describe --tags)\necho \"Deploying $VERSION\"\n\ndocker build -t app:$VERSION .\ndocker push app:$VERSION\nkubectl set image deployment/app app=app:$VERSION\n\necho \"Deployed $VERSION successfully\"\n\"\"\"\n\n  timeout: 62 # seconds\n  retry: 3\n}"
  }
