    title: "Log Entries"
    description: "Application log samples with raw multiline content."
    shapeIndex: 4
    mamlText: "{\n  application: \"architectures\"\n  log_format: \"structured\"\n  # Example stack trace\n  sample_error: \"\"\"\nError: We need to hack the redundant SSL monitor!\n    at /usr/excluding.ppt:222\n    at /usr/libdata/discrete_kaleidoscopic.msi:197\n    at process.main (node:internal/main:1:1)\n\"\"\"\n\n  # Sample HTTP request\n  sample_request: \"\"\"\nPUT /api/testing HTTP/1.1\nHost: immense-peninsula.biz\nUser-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (Linux; Android 11; SM-T800) AppleWebKit/579.45 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/115.7.19.8 Mobile Safari/603.51\nAccept: application/json\n\"\"\"\n  retention_days: 46\n}"
