    title: "Recipe"
    description: "A cooking recipe with ingredients and steps."
    shapeIndex: 3
    mamlText: "{\n  title: \"Swiss Chard And Feijoa Stew\"\n  servings: 8\n  prep_time: \"15 minutes\"\n  cook_time: \"104 minutes\"\n\n  # Ingredients\n  ingredients: [\n    \"1 lbs slivered almonds\"\n    \"1 lbs oranges\"\n    \"3 cups tangelo\"\n  ]\n\n  # Instructions\n  steps: [\n    \"A classic pie filled with delicious pigeon and tangy brown flour, baked in a tender pastry crust and topped with a golden-brown lattice.\"\n    \"A simple blood orange pie. No fancy stuff. Just pie.\"\n    \"Baked coconut water-stuffed pigeon, seasoned with garam masala and tender herbs, accompanied by roasted squash medley.\"\n    \"Grilled goose kebabs, marinated in Arab spices and served with a fresh green beans and fig salad.\"\n    \"Tenderly braised emu in a rich kaffir leaves and okra sauce, served with a side of creamy endive.\"\n  ]\n\n  nutrition: {\n    calories: 188\n    protein: \"48g\"\n    carbs: \"16g\"\n    fat: \"38g\"\n  }\n}"
  }
